  "stageId": "a001_ex01",
  "title": "大地惊雷",
  "storyCode": "GT-EX-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "137eb33e1eebe89f0e36f82d8ee76f07bdca1f1a80a309d4c798ee6eee5f4bb8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......我们该把他塞进麻袋，\n在黎明时吊上桅杆......\n......我们该把他喉咙切断，\n在暴风雨里献给大海......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "......又是这个梦吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "——原来是你。唔，不过为什么我想不起来你叫什么名字了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这不重要。你把我当成一个普通的罗德岛干员就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你看上去似乎很痛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "只是噩梦而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "一些盘旋在意识里的黑色碎片，藏在那个破碎教堂的阴影之下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "在我接近它的时候，它们化为枷锁将我拖入深邃的海中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不过很快你就有办法脱离痛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "是吗，呵呵，那可真是太好了。不过我为什么相信你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "你身上的气息......我很熟悉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "不，不是，是气味。浓烈的气味，血的气味，它们的气味。深邃的海中的气味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "熟悉，但又让人厌恶的气味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "能告诉我你的名字吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "斯卡蒂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "有趣。那么你为什么能出现在这里呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "没有凯尔希的许可，你可没法到这个房间里来，除非你也不怕被失去控制的我撕成碎片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "害怕。所有人都害怕。只是我已经习惯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是时候出发了，回来的时候，情况也许会有所进展。不过，你也可以和以前一样，把我忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "你要去哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "秘密被埋葬的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "一个离你很远的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
